,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"mx6_m2e_8ho","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0213","start":213,"end":214,"surface":"兄","kind":"person","person_id":"4kp_bwq_ayu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0235","start":235,"end":236,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4kp_bwq_ayu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0262","start":262,"end":264,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cdj_nwi_319","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0265","start":265,"end":266,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4kp_bwq_ayu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0280","start":280,"end":282,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"l5d_ywu_jfb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"l5d_ywu_jfb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0309","start":309,"end":311,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cdj_nwi_319","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0316","start":316,"end":320,"surface":"大長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"suw_tds_nwl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0323","start":323,"end":325,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cdj_nwi_319","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0326","start":326,"end":328,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cdj_nwi_319","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0335","start":335,"end":336,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4kp_bwq_ayu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0341","start":341,"end":342,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4kp_bwq_ayu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0350","start":350,"end":352,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cdj_nwi_319","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0364","start":364,"end":366,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cdj_nwi_319","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0381","start":381,"end":383,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"l5d_ywu_jfb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0387","start":387,"end":389,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cdj_nwi_319","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0390","start":390,"end":393,"surface":"長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"suw_tds_nwl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m002-0395","start":395,"end":397,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p005","text":"公孫詭、羊勝説孝王求爲帝太子及益地事，恐漢大臣不聽，乃陰使人刺漢用事謀臣。及殺故呉相袁盎，景帝遂聞詭、勝等計畫，乃遣使捕詭、勝，必得。漢使十輩至梁，相以下舉國大索，月餘不得。內史安國聞詭、勝匿孝王所，安國入見王而泣曰：「主辱臣死。大王無良臣，故事紛紛至此。今詭、勝不得，請辭賜死。」王曰：「何至此？」安國泣數行下，曰：「大王自度於皇帝，孰與太上皇之與高皇帝及皇帝之與臨江王親？」孝王曰：「弗如也。」安國曰：「夫太上、臨江親父子之閒，然而高帝曰『提三尺劍取天下者朕也』，故太上皇終不得制事，居于櫟陽。臨江王，適長太子也，以一言過，廢王臨江；用宮垣事，卒自殺中尉府。何者？治天下終不以私亂公。語曰：『雖有親父，安知其不爲虎？雖有親兄，安知其不爲狼？』今大王列在諸侯，悅一邪臣浮説，犯上禁，橈明法。天子以太后故，不忍致法於王。太后日夜涕泣，幸大王自改，而大王終不覺寤。有如太后宮車即晏駕，大王尚誰攀乎？」語未卒，孝王泣數行下，謝安國曰：「吾今出詭、勝。」詭、勝自殺。漢使還報，梁事皆得釋，安國之力也。於是景帝、太后益重安國。孝王卒，共王即位，安國坐法失官，居家。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"公孫詭","kind":"person","person_id":"v4l_7vt_hsb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"羊勝","kind":"person","person_id":"ezo_6oj_gne","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"l5d_ywu_jfb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4kp_bwq_ayu","